+  <text x="266" y="403" fill="#ffb3b3" font-family="monospace" font-size="9">                     qv10     clifft_v2_coop     x1 (1270.2us) + clifft_v2_spec x2 (1667.2us)</text>
+  <text x="266" y="423" fill="#8ff7bf" font-family="monospace" font-size="9">noise-specialized    frame_h  clifft_v2_spec     x1 (10.5us)</text>
