+  <text x="695" y="487" fill="#8ff7bf" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">specialized sampling dispatch</text>
+  <path d="M266 507 V514 H804 V507" fill="none" stroke="#ff7777" stroke-width="1.5"/>
+  <text x="535" y="528" fill="#ff9b9b" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">the digester sums every dispatch into the reported kernel time</text>
+  <text x="535" y="543" fill="#dfe3ed" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9" text-anchor="middle">the gate compares both executions, then the real sampling dispatch runs</text>
+
+  <!-- Apparent regressions and fix -->
+  <rect x="836" y="347" width="240" height="204" rx="9" fill="#0d0d1a" fill-opacity="0.76" stroke="#cc2222" stroke-width="1.5"/>
+  <text x="956" y="369" fill="#ffffff" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">APPARENT RATIOS</text>
+  <text x="852" y="392" fill="#dfe3ed" font-family="monospace" font-size="10">frame_h</text>
+  <text x="936" y="392" fill="#ff7777" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">0.612 → 2.859</text>
+  <text x="852" y="414" fill="#dfe3ed" font-family="monospace" font-size="10">circuit_d3</text>
+  <text x="936" y="414" fill="#ff7777" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">1.116 → 2.117</text>
+  <text x="852" y="436" fill="#dfe3ed" font-family="monospace" font-size="10">qv10</text>
+  <text x="936" y="436" fill="#ff7777" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">0.252 → 0.675</text>
+  <text x="956" y="458" fill="#ff5555" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" filter="url(#glowRed)">nothing had actually slowed down.</text>
+  <rect x="852" y="471" width="208" height="29" rx="14.5" fill="#00cc66" fill-opacity="0.16" stroke="#00cc66" stroke-width="1.5"/>
+  <text x="956" y="490" fill="#00ff80" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" filter="url(#glowGreen)">bbb5e42 · persisted &lt;hsaco&gt;.gate</text>
+  <text x="956" y="514" fill="#8ff7bf" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle">“that polluted kernel traces with</text>
+  <text x="956" y="527" fill="#8ff7bf" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle">clifft_v2_coop+spec dispatches summed by</text>
+  <text x="956" y="540" fill="#8ff7bf" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle">the digester → inflated times.”</text>
+
+  <!-- Bottom punchline -->
+  <rect x="24" y="574" width="1052" height="40" rx="8" fill="#e94560" fill-opacity="0.14" stroke="#e94560"/>
+  <text x="550" y="591" fill="#ffffff" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">A correctness mechanism that runs on the measurement path becomes a performance number.</text>
+  <text x="550" y="607" fill="#dfe3ed" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9.5" text-anchor="middle">Three of these eight circuits would have been reported as 2–4× regressions by anyone reading the table without the commit history.</text>
+</svg>

