+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1100" height="620" viewBox="0 0 1100 620" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
+  <title id="title">Compile Once, Validate Once, Then Choose</title>
+  <desc id="desc">The V2 specialization lifecycle, its three distinct caches, safe interpreter fallback, and the profiling incident caused by an in-process-only verdict cache.</desc>
+
+  <defs>
+    <linearGradient id="cyanFill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
