+  <rect x="116" y="280" width="868" height="12" rx="6" fill="#53d8fb" fill-opacity="0.08"/>
+  <text x="550" y="289" fill="#9cecff" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="9.5" font-style="italic" text-anchor="middle">“NEVER re-run during a profiled sample dispatch — the gate's own validation dispatches would otherwise pollute rocprofv3 kernel traces.”</text>
